// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- You stayed. Good. I'd started drawing you out of my map of the ship. In pencil, luckily.   #funny
? endgame:early
- Booth queue this week was eleven minutes. Half of it was people telling home you stayed.   #funny
? endgame
- Ordinary days. I like an ordinary day. Nothing on it to correct.
? endgame:early
- Gran asked who "the one who stayed" was. I said it's a long message. She likes those.   #warm
